.Sh TRANSITION (6.4.10)
Deployment consists of:
.Bl -enum -compact
.It
Clone repository and run
.Ic git config core.hooksPath .githooks .
The post-checkout hook builds
.Nm index.cgi
automatically.
.It
Configure the HTTP server to pass requests under
.Pa /podcast/
to the FastCGI socket bound to
.Nm index.cgi .
.It
Install the cron entry:
.Dl 0 0 * * * /path/to/podcast.sh --playlist
.El
